{"diagnosis": "Fetch makes no progress with max_addr=0x00000000 vs expected advancing fetch. reg_next_pc <= current_pc mirrors current_pc with no stride so reg_next_pc never leaves 0. Root cause in excerpt at lines 1526-1527 is missing +2/+4 increment using latched_compr for compressed vs normal instr.", "patch_diff": "diff --git a/picorv32.v b/picorv32.v
--- a/picorv32.v
+++ b/picorv32.v
@@ -1526,2 +1526,2 @@
 				reg_pc <= current_pc;
-				reg_next_pc <= current_pc;
+				reg_next_pc <= current_pc + (latched_compr ? 2 : 4);
", "expected": "tohost PASS (not FAIL 0xdead), max_addr>0x00000000 with steady fetch progress, no TRAP no progress"}

